The Contractor shall supply all equipment and facilities necessary to meet the requirements of this technical specification, including, but not limited to:
1. Chillers, Cooling Towers, Condenser & Chilled water pumps, Air Handling Units, Fan Coil Units, ECS fans, Split A/c, different dampers required for ECS system, Louvers, Grilles & Diffusers, piping, Duct work, cable trays, cabling and MCC's along with DBs etc. required for efficient working of ECS system.
2. All auxiliary equipment such as: conical fan inlets and outlets, sound attenuators, ducts and inspection covers
3. All cable trays, cables and cabling necessary for the ECS and TVS Works;
4. All panels for the operation of the TVS and ECS works.
5. Enclosures and supporting brackets for housing and fixing equipment;
6. Power supply and distribution panel, circuit breakers, and isolators;
7. All equipment associated with any interfaces required to ensure operation within the performance requirements;
8. All special test equipment and tools, including data configuration tools;
